## opponent — Opposition strength context

| Field | Description | Reason to include |
|------|------------|------------------|
| opponent.name | Opponent team name | Narrative clarity |
| opponent.primary_domestic_competition | Opponent’s usual domestic league | Identifies cross-league strength in cups |
| opponent.ppg_at_time | Opponent PPG before the match | Stable strength signal (use current PPG for prototype) |
| opponent.league_position_at_time | League position at time of match | Secondary context only |
| opponent.strength_tier | Shaped tier from `1` to `5` | `1` easiest opposition, `5` hardest; extremes intentionally rare |

## opponent.strength_tier — Calculation

Use a shaped 5-tier scale:

- Tier `5` = top 10% of opponent PPG values
- Tier `4` = next 25%
- Tier `3` = middle 30%
- Tier `2` = next 25%
- Tier `1` = bottom 10%

This keeps tiers `1` and `5` deliberately rare while preserving a broad middle.

